WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.705
Today your child writes the last sound of a word.

2
00:00:03.155 --> 00:00:09.968
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.468 --> 00:00:13.047
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:13.547 --> 00:00:18.181
The last sound is easy to lose. By the time the pencil gets there, it is gone.

5
00:00:18.631 --> 00:00:22.479
So say the word slowly, and hold the end a little longer. Bus.

6
00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:30.793
The word is bus.

7
00:00:31.693 --> 00:00:33.221
Here is one more. Lid.

8
00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:41.771
The word is lid.

9
00:00:42.671 --> 00:00:48.582
Do job one together, all three pictures. Then name the pictures in job two, and step away.

10
00:00:49.032 --> 00:00:53.175
At the end, your child taps and says the sounds of three pictures for you.
